<title>UK: TI Group wins aerospace deals worth $100 mln.</title>
<headline>TI Group wins aerospace deals worth $100 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering firm TI Group Plc said on Monday it won two new aerospace contracts from U.S. group Raytheon Co worth a total of about $100 million.</p>
</text>
